---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { DOWNLOAD_URL, REPO_URL } from '../config';
---

<section class="final">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="final-card" data-reveal>
      <div class="final-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Start today</p>
      <h2>今天还有没做完的事。<br /><span class="grad">让它们有地方可去。</span></h2>
      <p class="final-lead">
        打开 Antigravity 侧边栏，写第一行。三分钟后，你会习惯它在。
      </p>
      <div class="final-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={REPO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <Icon name="github" />
          前往 GitHub
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={DOWNLOAD_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <Icon name="download" />
          下载 ZIP
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="final-note">MIT 开源 · 数据留在本机 · 随时卸载</p>

      <div class="final-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>MON</span><span>TUE</span><span>WED</span><span class="today">THU</span
        ><span>FRI</span><span>SAT</span><span>SUN</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final {
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px) clamp(64px, 8vw, 110px);
  }

  .final-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(44px, 7vw, 84px) clamp(24px, 5vw, 64px) 0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.02) 60%),
      #0a0c11;
  }

  .final-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 720px;
    height: 420px;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.34), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .final-card .eyebrow {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .final-card h2 {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.8vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    font-weight: 660;
  }

  .final-lead {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15.5px;
  }

  .final-actions {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .final-note {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .final-mark {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--line);
  }

  .final-mark span {
    padding: 14px 4px;
    background: #0a0c11;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .final-mark .today {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .final-mark {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>
